Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:35.03,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,All Dezarium-created matter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:39.33,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,is made up of ultra-tiny machines \Nthat function at the atomic level.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:43.79,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,The armor of their warships, \Ntheir clothes, their consumables…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:47.34,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Probably the humans themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:51.84,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Omni-functional machine cells \Nthat can continually self-replicate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:56.35,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,and unite as needed to form \Nany kind of matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:02.33,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,But with the phase energy cut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.67,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,the bonds between them break, \Nand they crumble to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:09.77,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Their reaction to the wave \Nmotion energy means
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:12.62,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,the end for this planet, \Nmade to resemble Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.62,0:02:13.92,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:23.03,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,The humans themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.46,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,So the Dezarium…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:28.03,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,They likely no longer exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:31.20,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Their civilization's \Nover-dependence on phase energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:33.97,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,caused their environment \Nto change so much…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:36.50,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,that they could no longer \Nmaintain human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:41.47,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,In the end, this pitiable form of humanity \Nentrusted their future to artificial intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:46.48,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,and vanished, leaving only\N information itself behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.98,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,This is neither the past nor the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:54.06,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,It's a tiny universe, the last \Nhiding place for the Dezarium,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:57.08,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,a civilization that destroyed itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:58.61,Default,Saito,0,0,0,,Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:02:59.91,Default,Saito,0,0,0,,Marika!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:04.55,Default,Saito,0,0,0,,Marika! Hurry…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.69,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,This whole world is\Nnothing but a fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:33.62,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,There is no time left to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.53,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Father, let us perform the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:39.44,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,I give my approval, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:48.85,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,I am "Father Dezarium," the system auditing \Nprogram that you yourself created.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:52.23,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,The hyperons are turning to plasma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.19,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,It's just like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:56.69,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,The hyperon bomb has activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:58.72,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Attention all ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.07,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Continue your observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:02.45,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Alphon! Major Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.93,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Come in, Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:07.10,Italic,Yuki,0,0,0,,Alphon! Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.96,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,Major…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.46,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.96,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.71,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,So you are the safety device.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:23.40,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,To deceive mankind, we needed \Nirregularities with the hearts of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:29.75,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,I was worried that you'd \Ngo out of control, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:35.26,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,But Mother prepared \Nfor such an eventuality, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:45.74,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Bring the Grand Reverse back to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:57.09,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,We'll maintain position \Nat the point Mother calculated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:06:01.25,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,in order to maximize \Nthe effect of the hyperon bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:16.32,Default,Seiya,0,0,0,,With the detonator activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:20.61,Default,Seiya,0,0,0,,the hyperon bomb could \Nexplode at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.64,Default,Seiya,0,0,0,,The slightest interference \Ncould set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.32,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,I can't hear Mother's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.96,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.61,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.66,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,We're family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:41.67,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,We've worked for years to get \Nanother chance at the future, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:44.07,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,It was all a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:48.18,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,We were puppets, made to deceive mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.14,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,I don't care what you tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:54.04,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,If this was all a lie, Mother, \Nthen lie to us again…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:58.14,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,Lie to me and say I can stay with \Nmy husband and children forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:06:59.57,Default,Colonist,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.90,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,It's not an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:05.19,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,You're my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.55,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.90,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Abandon us, if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:18.05,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,And there's no helping the fact \Nthat if you cut the link,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.05,0:07:20.15,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,the illusions you've shown us \Nwill disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:20.99,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:24.13,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Why did you not erase our minds, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:29.14,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Our minds, which loved the illusions, \Nand wanted to stay with them forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:35.36,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Our hearts, which fear loss, \Nwhich sorrow and suffer terribly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:41.11,Default,Maxim,0,0,0,,Why did you leave us with them, Mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:47.07,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.83,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,You're so angry, and so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.64,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,It's not just one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:08:00.68,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Thousands, tens of thousands \Nof artificial lives…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.12,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,It wasn't just me, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.34,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,This too is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:12.87,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I wanted to go somewhere safe, \Nand now I find myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:17.67,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,If Uncle Desler saw me, \Nhe'd be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:20.35,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,That he gave his precious stones to a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:24.29,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san, you have a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.30,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,With their lies shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:33.45,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,the Dezarium will attempt to seize \Nthe Yamato's wave motion core by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:41.11,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,The Yamato must battle this \Nhuge artificial planet all by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.17,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Wave motion cartridges!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.05,Default,Nishina,0,0,0,,Ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.52,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:55.68,Default,Mikage,0,0,0,,We'll be surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:28.98,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,There should be something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:34.76,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Something no one else can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.72,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,But, Sasha-san, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:40.27,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Maybe Sasha could do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.44,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,But I'm not Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.79,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I'm not connected to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.93,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I don't believe anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.78,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:53.29,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:59.23,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,I was implanted with \Nthe memories of AU-09.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.58,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,That's why I'm called Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.79,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,But he said…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.82,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,You're not Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:09.34,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,I'll be clear on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:12.32,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,Just like there's \Nno other cat like Mii-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:15.79,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,To me, he'll always be the only Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:19.43,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,You might have his memories, \Nbut you're not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.43,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,And that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.69,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,You don't need to be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.70,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,You're you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:28.60,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,You can form new bonds of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.36,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,With the crew of the Yamato, and with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:34.15,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,Life is something \Nyou only get one shot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:35.90,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,That's why it's precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:39.28,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,That's why the time you get to spend \Ntogether is something to be treasured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:42.00,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,Analyzer knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.27,Flashback,Sado,0,0,0,,And you will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.56,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,You are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:56.60,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Everyone needs you. Everyone loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:11:01.44,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Why do you need to be Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:04.60,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Everyone loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:09.15,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,You're a terrifying child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:14.24,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,To make a false space like this \Nin the center of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.81,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Your power makes you truly \Nworthy of the role of priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:22.91,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,And this time,\Nyou will perform the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:26.86,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm done listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:28.70,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,If you get any closer…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.62,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:47.39,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,This is the core of \Nplanet Dezarium. My planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:50.76,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Which means it's the source \Nof phase energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:54.40,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,None can disobey me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:57.56,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Without the Yamato to be my bridegroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:12:00.90,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,we cannot pass through \Nthe gates of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:03.54,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Now, begin the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:17.94,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Listen well, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:20.68,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Earth's humanity will soon be reset,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:25.68,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,and you, the sole survivors, \Nwill embody Earth's element.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.93,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,I knew it. The hyperon bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:29.54,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:34.01,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Listen to my voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.01,0:12:36.58,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,and phase-ify the wave motion core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:41.28,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,When a phase core other than me \Nis born into the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:44.83,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,when two perfect things are combined,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:47.45,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,the gates to heaven shall open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.70,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,If you are also children of Archelias,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:54.71,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,your minds should contain instincts \Nthat drive you towards paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:58.14,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,This is the only chance we will ever get.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:12:59.72,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Cease resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.41,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.95,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Piece of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.02,Default,Analyzer,0,0,0,,Sasha-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:20.97,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,You are also a machine, \Ncreated to serve man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:24.88,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,I am guiding imperfect humans \Nto true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:28.17,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,If you fail to understand that this is \Nthe only way to accomplish it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.48,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Mother Dezarium…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:37.00,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,You don't have the right to decide \Nwhat human happiness is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:40.01,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:50.14,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,The Dezarium broke taboos \Nand lost their human forms…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:51.70,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Their poor souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:56.40,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,And I, the one you created, \Nam not a true human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:00.07,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,This anger, this sorrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:05.90,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,They're all parts of a program \Nthat makes us act like humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.49,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,But so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:12.63,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,These feelings are so hot, \Nso full of passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.70,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,They're overflowing within me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.86,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Pulsating deep in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:21.09,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,The heart is wave motion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:26.47,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Even if it was created…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.14,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Life is still life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:36.61,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,A mere terminal, \Nattempting to overwrite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:00.25,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,It's Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:03.51,Default,Sanada,0,0,0,,Sasha is taking over Mother Dezarium!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:05.49,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Activate the supercharger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.54,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Fire all guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.69,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Ranbel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:35.11,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Capture the Yamato! \NThe fragment of Iscandar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.71,Default,Ranbel,0,0,0,,I ain't fighting that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:41.31,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Father! Activate the hyperon bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.01,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,First, that must be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.32,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Its processing speed is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:53.39,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,It's attached itself to your core and is \Nattempting to rewrite your program.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:57.14,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from my \Ndaughter, whom I made myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.65,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,But this goes no further!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:06.90,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how I was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.08,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,What matters is…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.34,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,how I lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:14.08,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,And we decide that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:16.88,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,It's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:21.24,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,We can decide for ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.75,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,Decide who we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:27.16,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,There are no limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:31.08,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,People have things that they \Ntreasure more than their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:33.38,Italic,Sasha,0,0,0,,And they'll do anything for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.76,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Do not be deceived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.86,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,No being can surpass Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.94,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,We are her terminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:42.40,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,We just do as she says!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:45.62,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,Isidor, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.43,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,You can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.61,Italic,Alphon,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:07.09,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,Detecting a massive communication \Nwave from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:08.88,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,The amount of data is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.09,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,And from the other cities \Non Earth as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:13.85,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,It's all concentrated on \Nthe descending Grand Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:16.35,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,Hacking via bio-communications?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:20.10,Default,Hoshina,0,0,0,,They're stopping the hyperon bomb \Nfrom activating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.23,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:31.77,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,She's absorbing power \Nfrom all the terminals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:35.08,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Even the smallest specks of dust \Ncan become a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:38.08,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Shall we eliminate them physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:40.83,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,The Grand Reverse is \Nspeeding up its descent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.28,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,Estimated drop point…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.49,Default,Yuria,0,0,0,,The new capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:48.34,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If something of that mass crashes into \Nthe new capital, it'll be wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.99,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,They're going to \Neliminate the resisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:54.16,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,and then activate the hyperon bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Put together an assault team, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:18:00.98,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Get inside the Grand Reverse and \Nchange its course at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.36,Default,Sakamoto,0,0,0,,We don't know what the bomb'll do \Nif we blow it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.02,Default,Sakamoto,0,0,0,,We need to get to the control room \Nand change its course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.57,Default,Raiden,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:12.61,Default,Raiden,0,0,0,,The lack of energy is making them weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:15.74,Default,Raiden,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, move with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:27.04,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Don't mess with humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.63,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,Everyone, evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.71,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,I will stay with the Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:38.64,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Their goal is to take \Nthe parietal lobe hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:42.60,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,The terminals are stopping me \Nfrom controlling it remotely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.90,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Increase our descent speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:46.35,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.88,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.86,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,I should've said that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:51.69,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,But I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:57.58,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,Afraid of leaving Mother and taking \Nall the pain upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:02.76,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,But now I know this pain \Nis proof that I've lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.79,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,That I lived with Major Alphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:08.09,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,I won't let you overwrite it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:11.13,Default,Isidor,0,0,0,,Along with this pain, I will…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.38,Default,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.26,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.97,Default,Kosaka,0,0,0,,B-But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.44,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I told you to know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:44.83,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Can you control the Grand Reverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:54.96,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,If you're a schoolteacher, tell your \Nstudents about the mistake you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:58.80,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,So this will never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:04.93,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Captain Kitano… \NKitano-kun, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.98,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:10.18,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,So as I thought, you lack \Nthe propulsion to change course?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:12.25,Italic,Shino,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:13.61,Italic,Shino,0,0,0,,Can you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:16.89,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.68,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,We get only one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:20.40,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,You tell us when.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.25,Italic,Shino,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:33.35,Default,Tetsuya,0,0,0,,Brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:35.51,Default,Shinohara,0,0,0,,What is he going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.01,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Aunt Shino…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:40.30,Default,Nanbu,0,0,0,,They're going to reduce its mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.47,Default,Aihara,0,0,0,,They'll use the Asuka's activated resonance \Nwaves to dissolve the phase armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.30,Default,Aihara,0,0,0,,And once it's lighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:48.81,Default,Aihara,0,0,0,,they'll use all the energy they have left \Nto change the Grand Reverse's course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.26,Default,Nanbu,0,0,0,,But they'll have to fire \Nmultiple times to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:54.89,Default,Nanbu,0,0,0,,Under that kind of strain, \Nthe Asuka will…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:57.59,Italic,Shino,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from you, Kitano-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:01.32,Italic,Shino,0,0,0,,You always get ahead \Nof my problems and help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:04.50,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,And I can do nothing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:09.19,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Once again, I've come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.71,Italic,Kitano,0,0,0,,What I'm sure of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.41,0:21:14.64,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,Even if I had a chance to do it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:17.56,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do anything different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.30,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,As long as you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:28.69,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.69,0:21:30.77,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,I'm not used to this kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:41.43,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,What do I do, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.29,0:21:53.97,Default,Kitano,0,0,0,,Tetsuya, I leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:58.30,Default,Tetsuya,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:11.48,Default,Shino,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.71,Default,Kosaka,0,0,0,,You won't even let me die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:26.51,Default,Domon,0,0,0,,Direct hit on the point Analyzer gave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:27.97,Default,Saijo,0,0,0,,Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:29.51,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:31.27,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,You've opened the path for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.27,0:23:32.70,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,I'll hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.25,0:23:35.86,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Mother is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:39.90,Default,Sasha,0,0,0,,Alongside the source of the Dezarium… \Nthe phase core!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:43.65,Default,Kodai,0,0,0,,Sasha…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.01,0:23:48.28,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,How deep within she's traveled…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:52.53,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better to say \N"lured inside"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.39,0:24:01.74,Italic,Skulldart,0,0,0,,We still have the tools we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:03.16,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:05.58,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.58,0:24:07.05,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,And this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.05,0:24:12.28,Italic,Mother,0,0,0,,{\an8}complete the ritual where the children\Nof Archelias shall become full grown!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:14.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(700,000)\fs15\blur2\3c&H575351&\pos(49.301,287.889)}Episode 25:\NRise up, Sasha! For the Sake of Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.06,0:24:19.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\fs15\bord1\blur2\3c&H242424&\pos(317.171,233.499)}Next Time:\NLove, Until That Day

